layout: template.njk
slug: estimate-kitchens
title: Estimate form for kitchen remodels (free PDF) | Jobchit
description: A free, printable estimate form for kitchen remodels. Cabinets, countertops, appliances, allowances, lead times, line items and total, with a line for the customer to sign. No account needed.
heading: Estimate for kitchens
sub: Cabinets, counters, appliances and allowances on one page, with line items, a total and a line for the customer to sign when they say yes.
tips:
  - Name the cabinet line, style and finish, and the countertop material and edge.
  - An allowance is what the price includes for something the customer picks later. If their pick costs more, the difference goes on a change order.
  - Write the lead time for cabinets and counters, so the customer knows when work can really start.
  - Put a date the price is good until. When the customer agrees, have them sign and date it, and keep a copy each.
---
